Casebench team server licence

No code is published under this directory yet.

Code under ee/ will be source-available, not Apache-2.0: free for any
organisation to run for itself, and not to be offered to third parties as a
service. The full licence text will be added here, reviewed by counsel,
before the first file under ee/ is published. Contributions to ee/ will
require a contributor licence agreement.

Everything outside ee/ is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, as
stated in the LICENSE file at the root of this repository.
